          "type": "lowpass",
          "f": 1200,
          "q": 0.707
        }
      ],
      "why": "B-flat bass (BBb tuba) from the VSCO tuba: more low end and a 1.2 kHz low-pass than the E-flat bass so the two bass desks differ. Harmonic centroid 2.87 against 4.15 (ChoraleBricks) and 1.81 (URMP) tubas; the Iowa tuba stayed at 4.3 or above even with a 400 Hz 24 dB/oct low-pass.",
      "range": [
